 custom networked physics system that lets you use EVERYTHING as a weapon makes for an immensely satisfying VR ruckus!\n\n- Battle Online - Fight your friends in a variety of competitive multiplayer modes including Free For All, No Guns, Team Deathmatch and Gold Rush!\n- Single Player Bots - Battle against or along-side clever AI bots so you're never alone!\n- Interact with Everything - Grab whatever you can get your hands on, and use it in battle! \n- Hang Out - Hit the saloon to have a virtual drink with a fellow Cowbot, make art out of a stack of chairs or join a battle. No consequences in this social area.\n- Customize your Avatar - Unlock cool gear to outfit your Cowbot or Alien with hats, shirts, vests or facial hair!\n\nAre you ready for a zany cartoon brawl?!", "short_description": "Cowbots and Aliens is a furious PvP Multiplayer VR brawl set in the Saloon-iverse! Free movement, laser precise gunplay, multiple competitive modes and a custom networked physics system that lets you use EVERYTHING as a weapon makes for an immensely satisfying VR ruckus!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chickenwaffle.com/cowbots-and-aliens-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Chicken Waffle", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://chickenwaffle.com/cowbots-and-aliens/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_S